        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. The recall period of a furloughed employee who, during the recall period, returns to the furloughing agency's payroll in a temporary capacity shall be extended by the amount of time the employee serves in the temporary capacity.",
            "block_bbox": [
